{"id":"171fc1f7452c6f4d","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-primitive-class.md","title":"thm-primitive-class","display":"thm-primitive-class","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-primitive-class]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-thm-birkhoff-variety]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"],"display":"thm-primitive-class","label":"93-thm-primitive-class","aliases":["93-thm-primitive-class"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64a7e9a3e5d98c15\" href=\"?note=64a7e9a3e5d98c15\" title=\"93-df-primitive-class\">93-df-primitive-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7e1d3c1baa2af88\" href=\"?note=f7e1d3c1baa2af88\" title=\"93-thm-birkhoff-variety\">93-thm-birkhoff-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-primitive-class"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-primitive-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-primitive-class</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-primitive-class-thm-primitive-class\">thm-primitive-class <code>thm-primitive-class</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64a7e9a3e5d98c15\" href=\"?note=64a7e9a3e5d98c15\" title=\"93-df-primitive-class\">93-df-primitive-class</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal K=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Prim}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal K=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>In the classical universal-algebra terminology fixed by the supporting definition, a primitive class is a variety and therefore exactly an HSP-closed class.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-primitive-class-thm-primitive-class","text":"thm-primitive-class `thm-primitive-class`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-primitive-class","status":"resolved","id":"6